- Watching another stream does not count.
- Going live does not count.
- Reconnecting cannot restart/farm qualification incorrectly.
- Duplicate realtime/LiveKit events cannot award multiple qualifications.
- Duplicate reward requests cannot award multiple 100-coin rewards.
- Client cannot directly award coins.
- Use unique indexes/constraints where appropriate.
- Use atomic database transactions/RPCs.
Also inspect existing account/fraud protections and integrate with them instead of duplicating them.

